---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - NumanX Tools"
  description="NumanX Tools privacy policy explains how we handle user data, cookies, third-party services, and your rights under GDPR and CCPA."
  keywords="privacy policy, numanx privacy, data protection, GDPR, cookies policy"
  canonical="https://numanx-tools.pages.dev/privacy-policy/"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy/' },
  ]}
>
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-16 pb-20 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute top-[10%] right-[5%] w-[300px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-purple-600/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Hero -->
      <section class="text-center mb-16 pt-8">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-700/50 bg-zinc-900/80 text-tertiary text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-8"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-purple-400"
            ><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"
            ></path></svg
          >
          Privacy &amp; Security
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-none">
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-purple-500 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >Privacy Policy</span
          >
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-tertiary text-sm">Last updated: January 2026</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-tertiary max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          NumanX Tools is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard
          your information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            NumanX Tools is designed to process everything locally in your browser. We do <strong class="text-primary"
              >not</strong
            > collect, store, or transmit any personal data, uploaded files, or generated content to any server.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-tertiary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span>
              <span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">No Account Required:</strong> You can use all tools without signing up or
                providing any personal information.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span>
              <span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">No File Uploads:</strong> All file processing happens entirely in your browser
                using the Canvas API. Files never leave your device.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span>
              <span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">No Tracking:</strong> We do not use fingerprinting, session recording, or
                user behavior tracking scripts.</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Cookies &amp; Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            NumanX Tools uses minimal cookies for basic website functionality. We may use third-party services that
            place their own cookies:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-tertiary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span>
              <span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Google AdSense:</strong> We may display advertisements via Google AdSense,
                which uses cookies to serve relevant ads based on your browsing history. Google&rsquo;s use of advertising
                cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and other sites on the Internet.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span>
              <span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Analytics:</strong> If enabled, we may use basic analytics to understand aggregate
                traffic patterns. No personally identifiable information is collected.</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            Since we don&rsquo;t collect personal information, there is minimal data usage. Any anonymous aggregate data
            is used solely to:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-tertiary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                >Improve website performance and user experience</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                >Monitor for technical issues and security threats</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span>Comply with legal obligations</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Your Rights (GDPR &amp; CCPA)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your data:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-tertiary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Right to Access:</strong> Request information about what data we hold about
                you.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Right to Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of any data associated with your
                usage.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Right to Opt-Out:</strong> You can opt out of personalized advertising via
                the <a
                  href="https://adssettings.google.com"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline">Google Ads Settings</a
                > page.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                ><strong class="text-secondary">Do Not Sell:</strong> We do not sell your personal information. Under CCPA,
                you have the right to know that no data selling occurs.</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of
            these external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before engaging.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            NumanX Tools does not knowingly collect any information from children under the age of 13. All tools are
            safe for general use and do not require personal data input.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated
            revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">8. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary leading-relaxed">
            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this privacy policy, please contact us:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-tertiary">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                >Email: <a
                  href="mailto:numanxstudio@gmail.com"
                  class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline">numanxstudio@gmail.com</a
                ></span
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-purple-400 mt-0.5">&bull;</span><span
                >Contact Form: <a href="/contact/" class="text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline"
                  >Visit our Contact page</a
                ></span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust Badges -->
      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔒</div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">256-bit Encryption</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-dim mt-0.5">Via HTTPS protocol</p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-4 text-center hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🛡️</div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Zero Data Storage</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-dim mt-0.5">No servers involved</p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-4 text-center hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌍</div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">GDPR Compliant</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-dim mt-0.5">Your rights protected</p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-4 text-center hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="text-2xl mb-2">✅</div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">CCPA Compliant</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-dim mt-0.5">No data sold</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="mt-12 text-center">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-8 shadow-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Questions About Privacy?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-tertiary mt-2">We&rsquo;re here to help. Reach out anytime.</p>
          <a
            href="/contact/"
            class="inline-block mt-4 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200"
          >
            Contact Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
